# aider-chat 0.86.2 pins idna==3.11; mcp 2.2.0 (the bridge's SDK) needs idna>=3.18 through httpx2. The
# venv has always had mcp's: aider was installed first and `pip install mcp` replaced idna after it
# (pip's own warning said so). Measured: that is the only package the second install moved.
idna==3.20
# aider-chat 0.86.2 also pins certifi==2026.1.4, gitpython==3.1.46 and anyio==4.12.1, each older than its
# security fixes. certifi 2026.10.19 drops the emSign root certificates whose intermediate keys were
# compromised. GitPython 3.2.1 closes command-execution and file-access holes reachable from repository
# content, and aider runs it on the session's repository. anyio 4.14.2 fixes TLS host-name encoding.
certifi==2026.10.19
gitpython==3.2.1
anyio==4.14.2
